{
  "_comment": "WhatsApp Flow for multi-answer (select-all-that-apply) training quiz questions.",
  "_instructions": [
    "1. Registered automatically by `npm run setup:flows` (flow-configs.js \u2192 'Training Multi-Answer Question').",
    "2. The resulting Flow ID is written to TRAINING_MSQ_FLOW_ID in your .env.",
    "3. Endpoint (data_api_version 3.0, encrypted): POST /api/flows/training-msq.",
    "4. ONE Flow serves EVERY multi-answer question: the question text, the option list and the",
    "   already-selected set are all supplied dynamically by the endpoint's INIT. There are no",
    "   per-option slots and no per-question Flow.",
    "5. Leaving TRAINING_MSQ_FLOW_ID unset is the rollback lever \u2014 delivery falls back to the",
    "   interactive-list + Done path with no deploy.",
    "6. Modelled on attendance-marking-flow.json (the proven dynamic-data CheckboxGroup pattern here)."
  ],
  "_notes": [
    "Option ids are the question's CANONICAL 1-based option indices, never display positions \u2014",
    "the endpoint orders the list per the attempt's seeded shuffle but the id always identifies",
    "the option the database knows, so the stored answer stays comparable with every historical row.",
    "init-values pre-checks a partially-answered question. Init-values only apply reliably once the",
    "Flow is PUBLISHED; on a DRAFT the boxes may render unchecked.",
    "The Footer completes the Flow rather than calling data_exchange: the selection is a single",
    "atomic submission, so there is nothing to round-trip and no ~10s endpoint budget to respect."
  ],
  "version": "6.2",
  "data_api_version": "3.0",
  "routing_model": {},
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "MSQ_QUESTION",
      "title": "Question",
      "terminal": true,
      "refresh_on_back": true,
      "data": {
        "progress": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Question 2 of 5"
        },
        "question_text": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Which of these are formative assessment techniques?"
        },
        "options": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "3",
              "title": "Exit tickets",
              "description": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "1",
              "title": "Cold calling",
              "description": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "title": "Think-pair-share",
              "description": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "title": "End-of-term exam",
              "description": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "title": "Annual report card",
              "description": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "selected": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "__example__": []
        },
        "attempt_ref": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000:1"
        },
        "training_msq_action": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "submit"
        },
        "max_selected": {
          "type": "number",
          "__example__": 5
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "msq_form",
            "init-values": {
              "selected_options": "${data.selected}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.progress}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.question_text}"
              },
              {
                "type": "CheckboxGroup",
                "name": "selected_options",
                "label": "Select all that apply",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.options}",
                "min-selected-items": 1,
                "max-selected-items": "${data.max_selected}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Submit answer",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "complete",
                  "payload": {
                    "selected_options": "${form.selected_options}",
                    "attempt_ref": "${data.attempt_ref}",
                    "training_msq_action": "${data.training_msq_action}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
